cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "U.S. Commodity Hedging Dataset: E&P, Airlines, and Refiners"
abstract: >
  A firm-year panel of commodity hedging positions extracted from SEC 10-K annual
  filings for three groups of U.S. publicly traded companies: oil and gas exploration
  and production firms (SIC 1311, 2,963 firm-years, 2000–2024), commercial airlines
  (421 firm-years, 2001–2025), and petroleum refiners (235 firm-years, 2002–2025).
  Hedging instruments and production/throughput denominators were extracted using a
  two-stage pipeline (deterministic HTML/SGML parsing followed by AI-assisted
  structured extraction). The dataset provides delta-adjusted hedge ratios for E&P
  firms, forward fuel coverage percentages for airlines, and net-short crude ratios
  for refiners, along with a harmonized cross-group master panel.
